{"title":"The Chairman Of Pharmaceutical Company Is A Poison King","synopsis":"\\[Oleh Author yang mengerjakan \\<A Wimp’s Strategy Guide to Conquer the Tower>]\n\n300 tahun di masa depan, Bumi diselimuti oleh mana.\n\nAku adalah seorang \"Mana Reject,\" yang berarti mana adalah racun bagiku.\n\nSuatu hari, saat aku menunggu ajalku tanpa pernah mengalami kebangkitan, aku terhubung dengan versi lain dari jiwaku dari dimensi yang berbeda.\n\nDewa Racun Tertinggi, Tang Gun-ak, penguasa tertinggi dari Gangho.","alternative_title":"The Supreme Poison Demon Becomes A Pharma Chairman, 제약회사 회장님은 절대독마","author":"Kuchikuchi","artist":"Bichon Studio","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Martial Arts"],"chapters":[{"id":"ecb3f84c-3c91-4804-9fbf-96c5a3b2872d","number":"25","title":"Chapter 25","date":"2026-07-01","images":[]},{"id":"ee4dbe69-5f3a-4880-8470-89795d07dbde","number":"24","title":"Chapter 24","date":"2026-06-24","images":[]},{"id":"7e5cae22-ce60-4b00-90c0-b911769f938e","number":"23","title":"Chapter 23","date":"2026-06-17","images":[]},{"id":"c6a8ac28-2b42-485a-8dc1-2346f1c2de5b","number":"22","title":"Chapter 22","date":"2026-06-17","images":[]},{"id":"686f6dba-bf63-4da8-83d4-b7dc270f5608","number":"21","title":"Chapter 21","date":"2026-03-25","images":[]},{"id":"e784733d-83e9-4ba8-a117-fb25bbf5f560","number":"20","title":"Chapter 20","date":"2026-03-24","images":[]},{"id":"28144f3a-3e5d-4eee-832b-2fae4f074cd5","number":"19","title":"Chapter 19","date":"2026-03-24","images":[]},{"id":"e5d42bc5-7835-451f-a9e2-1c68875d76be","number":"18","title":"Chapter 18","date":"2026-03-24","images":[]},{"id":"1925ad9b-abe2-4c09-8b08-73a82fbc5bb9","number":"17","title":"Chapter 17","date":"2026-03-24","images":[]},{"id":"fe93008d-78c5-48ec-b3bf-5fe6f3694993","number":"16","title":"Chapter 16","date":"2026-03-24","images":[]},{"id":"f850cb62-3ff3-412c-8884-4e8cdb76f2ab","number":"15","title":"Chapter 15","date":"2026-03-24","images":[]},{"id":"07e49f4c-4878-4096-9bf9-793ca92b2